{"version":1,"content":"<p>南非研究人員發現，光學纖維中存在一種長期被忽視的磁光現象。這一發現可能讓光纖傳感器不必再纏繞在電纜上，也能監測地下電纜中的電流，同時為光計算提供一種用電流操控光的新途徑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1587346.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.066206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:20:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:13.154798+00:00","content_hash":"5f9cf8e20e9972497efe418a47e613d29a7960c0777ee17132277a49b1c7aafc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}